# Build context of docker/Dockerfile (the repository root), 012-install-doctor-docker. BuildKit reads this file because
# it sits next to the Dockerfile (a .dockerignore at the product root would add a root entry, 006 TS-001).
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/target
**/.next
**/engine-dist
**/coverage
**/bin
**/obj
**/.archview
**/*.log
docker/.env
specs
tests
engine/test-for-demo
engine/src/test
